Package: distlab
Title: Interactive Laboratory for Probability Distributions
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(person(given = "José Evandeilton",
                    family = "Lopes",
                    role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
                    email = "evandeilton@gmail.com",
                    comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0007-5887-4084")))
Description: A 'shiny' dashboard and a distribution engine for teaching
    probability distributions. Each distribution is described by a registry
    entry (support, parameters, formulas and story) and can be explored
    interactively, with density, distribution, quantile and random
    generation functions and exact moments. The interface is available in
    Brazilian Portuguese and English.
